{"3906800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Poua! – Your Pomodoro Buddy & Minimal Desktop Timer", "steam_appid": 3906800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/4c74dbb1f3fc11e281e144f67a30e339.poster.avif?t=1786549615\" width=940 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/4c74dbb1f3fc11e281e144f67a30e339.webm?t=1786549615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/4c74dbb1f3fc11e281e144f67a30e339.mp4?t=1786549615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Poua</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are too many fun things in the world.<br>Notifications, pop-ups and more. Even at this moment, dozens of dopamine triggers are tempting you.<br>Losing focus is not because your willpower is weak, but because your environment is too strong.<br>That's why Poua has come to help you focus.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The power of a gaze</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/a1eef4af64a2c1f36707f5d942951fa8.poster.avif?t=1786549615\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/a1eef4af64a2c1f36707f5d942951fa8.webm?t=1786549615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/a1eef4af64a2c1f36707f5d942951fa8.mp4?t=1786549615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poua looks your cursor. This is an intentional cue grounded in the &quot;observer effect&quot;, the tendency for people to adjust behavior when they feel observed. That subtle sense of being watched can nudge you back on task and help reduce distractions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hear your goal, stay on track</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/81012b5a5b06693aa5b41a0c20cc5c9b.poster.avif?t=1786549615\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/81012b5a5b06693aa5b41a0c20cc5c9b.webm?t=1786549615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/81012b5a5b06693aa5b41a0c20cc5c9b.mp4?t=1786549615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a session begins or your attention drifts, Poua can speak your preset goal and show it on screen. You control the frequency, and you can turn it on or off at any time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Celebrate your progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/c7e3be6a679ac0b3e1389462a4f26e61.poster.avif?t=1786549615\" width=616 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/c7e3be6a679ac0b3e1389462a4f26e61.webm?t=1786549615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/c7e3be6a679ac0b3e1389462a4f26e61.mp4?t=1786549615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points for dedicated focus and unlock surprise hat boxes. Dress up Poua with the hats you discover, and turn consistent effort into cheerful rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete with Your Past Self</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/1fa17d65df45e8d23ed90f74ea675ad9.poster.avif?t=1786549615\" width=616 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/1fa17d65df45e8d23ed90f74ea675ad9.webm?t=1786549615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/1fa17d65df45e8d23ed90f74ea675ad9.mp4?t=1786549615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yesterday's you by racing against your own focus records. To deepen the immersion, you can revisit your past goals and even see the hats your past self was wearing. It's a friendly rivalry that keeps you motivated to stay consistent and outdo yourself day after day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stats!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/051fd7b846f895eaacc2ca9e0ee7ca05.poster.avif?t=1786549615\" width=306 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/051fd7b846f895eaacc2ca9e0ee7ca05.webm?t=1786549615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/051fd7b846f895eaacc2ca9e0ee7ca05.mp4?t=1786549615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/46061ab7900e34b414621124ce8048d5.poster.avif?t=1786549615\" width=306 height=246 ><source sr