/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pause and resume sessions effortlessly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can run seamless automatic repeat cycles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can keep the widget always on top for quick glanceability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adjust size and position to fit your workspace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to its transparent background, it stays out of your way while you work.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Poua</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are too many fun things in the world.<br>Notifications, pop-ups and more. Even at this moment, dozens of dopamine triggers are tempting you.<br>Losing focus is not because your willpower is weak, but because your environment is too strong.<br>That's why Poua has come to help you focus.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The power of a gaze</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/a1eef4af64a2c1f36707f5d942951fa8.poster.avif?t=1786549615\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/a1eef4af64a2c1f36707f5d942951fa8.webm?t=1786549615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/a1eef4af64a2c1f36707f5d942951fa8.mp4?t=1786549615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poua looks your cursor. This is an intentional cue grounded in the &quot;observer effect&quot;, the tendency for people to adjust behavior when they feel observed. That subtle sense of being watched can nudge you back on task and help reduce distractions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hear your goal, stay on track</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\">